Brand hardware maintenance and backup plan
title end

paragraph start
Brand master files are kept in at least two places on different devices. Devices get a regular check for updates, storage space and condition.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Backups never contain passwords or recovery codes. Name the folders and the schedule here, not any access details.
paragraph end

